            {
               "text": "### Images from Tikal\n\nThese images are copyright for Tikal and allowed to be used according to the license determined by them.\n\nTo visualize all images, use the left and right arrows on the slide below.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><div class=\"htSlides\"><div class=\"htSlide\"><div class=\"htSlideCounter\">1 / 3</div><img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"gc\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('gc', '0%')\"><div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Water reservoir in Tikal, Guatemala (<htcite0>). Photo taken on <htdate0>, during a visit to the site.</div><div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b><ul><li>Cooking - The preparation of food is often remembered for adding quantities, but there is also another side to it. (<htcite1>)</li><li>Integers - The integers that we have not yet studied are... (<htcite2>)</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"htSlide\"><div class=\"htSlideCounter\">2 / 3</div><img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"imgTikal0\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgTikal0', '0%')\"><div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Photo taken on <htdate1>, during a visit to the archaeological site of Tikal, Guatemala (<htcite3>).</div><div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b><ul><li>The result is (Phase II) - a game to reinforce the connection between addition and multiplication. (<htcite4>)</li><li>Translation game (Part I) - Explore numbers from different cultures through an engaging translation game. (<htcite5>)</li><li>The result is - a game of consecutive sums that helps uncover the story. (<htcite6>)</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"htSlide\"><div class=\"htSlideCounter\">3 / 3</div><img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"imgTikal1\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgTikal1', '0%')\"><div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Gran Jaguar Temple in Tikal, Guatemala (<htcite7>). Photo taken on <htdate2> during a site visit.</div><div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b><ul><li>Understanding the Multiplication Table (8 and 9) - What would happen if we left the plane? And if we went deeper inside? (<htcite8>)</li></ul></div></div><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-left htSlidePrev\" onclick=\"htPlusDivs(-1);\"></i><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right htSlideNext\" onclick=\"htPlusDivs(1);\"></i></div></p>",
